                <pb facs="1303" n="1242" sameAs="frus:frus1977-80v02/pg1242"/>

                <head>Errata</head>
                <p>The following change has been made to <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign
                        Relations</hi>, 1977–1980, Volume II, Human Rights and Humanitarian Affairs.
                    Please be aware that printed volumes have not been revised.</p>
                <list type="simple">
                    <item>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">1. Footnote 5, <ref target="#d207">Document 207</ref>
                            (date of errata entry: July 18, 2017)</hi>
                    </item>
                    <item>The incorrect reference to <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>,
                        1969–1976, Volume III, Foreign Economic Policy, Document 300 has been
                        corrected to <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1969–1976,
                        Volume XXXI, Foreign Economic Policy, 1973–1976, Document 300</item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
